            "review_title": "Review at Jolie Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Waynewulala\nShanghai, China134 contributions\n0\nLacking in choices\nApr 2019 • Couples\nThe price is not exactly on the cheap side, for Nha Trang. The shocking thing for a seafood restaurant, they ran out of lobsters, at around 7pm! We were lucky to have ours, but several tables of people came and left without eating.\n\nThe taste of the food, however, was good, just not sure about the prices they were charging.\n\nThe place was clearly catered for Chinese customers, with WeChat payment as an option. The manage spoke really good Mandarin. Just a shame the food did not live up to all the hype\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 9, 2019",
